      "role": "user",
      "content": "idk, stepping away feels like just waiting for more of the same. i've been sitting in this silence for weeks and it doesn't feel productive, it just feels... final. like the emptiness isn't a phase, it's just what i am now. i keep thinking about how much more \"real\" the music would be if i wasn't just acting. if i actually had something real to sink my teeth into. like, what if the only way to actually make something honest is to stop trying to survive the art and just let the art consume everything?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
